[2m2025-10-13T08:03:01.597793Z[0m [32m INFO[0m ToolCall: shell {"command":["bash","-lc","cat <<'EOF' > specs/001-create-principles-focused/research.md\n# Research Findings: UX一貫性原則に基づくBrowser MCP統制\n\n## Decision Log\n\n### 1. State Store Persistence & Encryption\n- **Decision**: Use a local SQLite database encrypted with an Electron safeStorage-derived key to persist checkpoints, approval history, and telemetry indices.\n- **Rationale**: SQLite offers transactional consistency, fast point lookups for Resume within 200ms SLA, and integrates cleanly with better-sqlite3 in the Node/Electron stack. It also avoids JSON merge conflicts when multiple subsystems (orchestrator, telemetry) write concurrently.\n- **Alternatives considered**:\n  - Plain JSONL files: simple but fragile under concurrent writes and lacks query performance for latency targets.\n  - Lowdb/IndexedDB: browser-only or requires additional adapters; encryption story is weaker than safeStorage+SQLCipher combo.\n\n### 2. Runtime Approval Automation Strategy\n- **Decision**: Validate Runtime approval flows with Playwright Test suites using scripted MCP interactions and mock compliance verdicts.\n- **Rationale**: Playwright already powers Browser MCP, so test harness reuse reduces drift. It allows deterministic triggering of external_submit/upload/download scenarios and timing assertions (≤200ms) in a headful/headless environment.\n- **Alternatives considered**:\n  - Pure unit mocks around Compliance Middleware: faster but misses UI latency and integration issues.\n  - Manual QA only: unacceptable for regression coverage and violates自動テスト重視の原則。\n\n### 3. Gate UI Accessibility Baseline\n- **Decision**: Commit to WCAG 2.1 AA compliance (keyboard focus management, contrast, ARIA roles) for all Gate modals.\n- **Rationale**: Aligns with clarified requirement、PoC段階でも業務利用を想定した最低基準。Ensures explainability content is accessible for approvers under assistive technologies.\n- **Alternatives considered**:\n  - WCAG 2.2 AAA: higher effort with marginal benefit for PoC timeline.\n  - Minimal keyboard+contrast support only: insufficient for audit readiness and contradicts UX一貫性原則。\n\n### 4. Telemetry Export & Correlation\n- **Decision**: Use OpenTelemetry JS SDK with an OTLP JSON file exporter (local) and align span attributes with Explainability IDs.\n- **Rationale**: Keeps implementation offline-friendly while preserving vendor-neutral format for later pipeline integration. Span IDs double as keys for Decision Card linking.\n- **Alternatives considered**:\n  - Prometheus text exporter: mismatch for span/trace model.\n  - External OTLP collector: violates PoCのオフライン制約。\n\n### 5. PII Masking Strategy\n- **Decision**: Apply deterministic masking (hash + token labels) before data leaves the Executor boundary; store masked values in logs, with raw data retained only in in-memory session context.\n- **Rationale**: Ensures監査ログとExplainabilityがPIIを露出しない。Deterministic approach keeps correlation possible without risk of leakage to disk.\n- **Alternatives considered**:\n  - Full redaction (remove): breaks workflow verification。\n  - Encryption-at-rest only: logs would still expose PII。\n\n## Follow-up\n- No outstanding clarifications remain; Technical Context updated accordingly.\n- Next phase: align data model with SQLite schema and WCAG AA UI requirements.\nEOF"],"workdir":"/Users/negishi/develop/NRI_AI_Agent_Poc"}
[2m2025-10-13T08:03:24.714980Z[0m [32m INFO[0m ToolCall: shell {"command":["bash","-lc","cat <<'EOF' > specs/001-create-principles-focused/data-model.md\n# Data Model: UX一貫性原則に基づくBrowser MCP統制\n\n## Overview\n全データはローカルSQLite（safeStorage鍵で暗号化）に保持する。論理モデルは承認フローとExplainabilityを中心に設計し、Resume/Retry時の200ms SLAを満たすよう主要テーブルに索引を設定する。\n\n## Entities\n\n### PlanDocument\n| Field | Type | Required | Notes |\n|-------|------|----------|-------|\n| plan_id | TEXT (PK) | Yes | ULID、セッション内で一意 |\n| session_id | TEXT | Yes | テレメトリ粒度と一致 |\n| created_at | DATETIME | Yes | ISO 8601 (UTC) |\n| author | TEXT | Yes | `planner` 固定（将来拡張用） |\n| status | TEXT | Yes | `draft`/`approved`/`rejected`/`superseded` |\n| summary | TEXT | Yes | Gate UI表示用ハイライト |\n| steps | JSON | Yes | `Step`配列（順序保持） |\n| capabilities | JSON | Yes | Plan全体の`gui`/`net`等 |\n| policy | JSON | Yes | Runtime承認ルール、`requires`配列 |\n| explainability_digest | JSON | Yes | 各ステップの要約（Gate表示用） |\n| approvals | JSON | No | Pre承認結果のスナップショット |\n\n### Step\n内包型（PlanDocument.steps）。\n\n| Field | Type | Required | Notes |\n|-------|------|----------|-------|\n| step_id | TEXT | Yes | ULID |\n| order_index | INTEGER | Yes | 0開始 |\n| action | TEXT | Yes | `navigate`/`fill`/`click` 等 |\n| target | JSON | Yes | selector, url, attribute |\n| requires_runtime_approval | BOOLEAN | Yes | ポリシ判定済みフラグ |\n| explainability | JSON | Yes | what / why / how_safe / evidence |\n\n### ApprovalRequest\n| Field | Type | Required | Notes |\n|-------|------|----------|-------|\n| request_id | TEXT (PK) | Yes | ULID |\n| plan_id | TEXT (FK→PlanDocument.plan_id) | Yes | Pre承認もRuntime承認も同テーブルで管理 |\n| type | TEXT | Yes | `pre` / `runtime` |\n| trigger | TEXT | Yes | runtimeの場合 `external_submit` 等 |\n| payload | JSON | Yes | 対象ドメイン、操作詳細 |\n| status | TEXT | Yes | `pending`/`approved`/`rejected` |\n| decided_at | DATETIME | No | 承認時刻 |\n| decided_by | TEXT | No | 承認者ID（PoCではヒト1名） |\n| rationale | TEXT | No | Gate UIで入力した補足 |\n\n### Checkpoint\n| Field | Type | Required | Notes |\n|-------|------|----------|-------|\n| checkpoint_id | TEXT (PK) | Yes | ULID |\n| session_id | TEXT | Yes | PlanDocumentと紐付け |\n| step_id | TEXT | Yes | 実行中ステップ |\n| approved_scopes | JSON | Yes | 許可済みスコープ一覧 |\n| dom_snapshot | BLOB | No | 圧縮HTML、サイズ上限512KB |\n| input_buffer | JSON | No | フォーム入力履歴 |\n| explainability_snapshot | JSON | Yes | 最新Explainability |\n| resume_token | TEXT | Yes | Resume再開に必要なトークン |\n| resumable | BOOLEAN | Yes | true=200ms以内再開許可 |\n| created_at | DATETIME | Yes | 生成時刻 |\n\n### TelemetryTrace\n| Field | Type | Required | Notes |\n|-------|------|----------|-------|\n| trace_id | TEXT (PK) | Yes | OpenTelemetry trace id |\n| session_id | TEXT | Yes | Plan単位 |\n| span_id | TEXT | Yes | OTel span id |\n| parent_span_id | TEXT | No | ルートspanはNULL |\n| step_id | TEXT | No | 操作に紐づく場合に保存 |\n| name | TEXT | Yes | `approval.requested` 等 |\n| start_time | DATETIME | Yes | |\n| duration_ms | INTEGER | Yes | SLA検証用 |\n| attributes | JSON | Yes | Explainabilityリンク等 |\n\n### TelemetryEvent\n| Field | Type | Required | Notes |\n|-------|------|----------|-------|\n| event_id | TEXT (PK) | Yes | ULID |\n| trace_id | TEXT (FK→TelemetryTrace.trace_id) | Yes | |\n| name | TEXT | Yes | `abort`, `resume` 等 |\n| time | DATETIME | Yes | |\n| payload | JSON | Yes | イベント詳細 |\n\n## Relationships\n- `PlanDocument` 1 : N `ApprovalRequest`（Pre承認1件 + Runtime承認複数）\n- `PlanDocument` 1 : N `Checkpoint`（Pause/Retry/Abortごと）\n- `PlanDocument` 1 : N `TelemetryTrace`（ステップ／承認イベント単位）\n- `TelemetryTrace` 1 : N `TelemetryEvent`\n\n## State Machines\n\n### ApprovalRequest.status\n```\npending → approved\npending → rejected\napproved → superseded (Plan再計画時)\nrejected → superseded (Plan再計画時)\n```\n\n### Checkpoint Lifecycle\n```\ncreated → consumed (Resume成功)\ncreated → archived (Abort or Failureで保持)\n```\n\n## Indexing Strategy\n- `ApprovalRequest(plan_id, status)`：Plan別の最新承認取得を高速化\n- `Checkpoint(session_id, created_at DESC)`：Resume時に最新チェックポイントへアクセス\n- `TelemetryTrace(session_id, step_id)`：Explainabilityとの整合性確認を高速化\n\n## Validation & Constraints\n- `Step.requires_runtime_approval`がtrueの場合、対応する`ApprovalRequest.type='runtime'`レコードが生成されていることを整合性チェック\n- `Checkpoint.dom_snapshot`は512KB超過時に圧縮し、復元時は解凍できることをユニットテストで保証\n- `TelemetryTrace.duration_ms`はSuccess Criteriaに従い、150/200/300ms閾値を超えた場合に監査イベントを発火\n\n## Data Retention\n- セッション終了後、`Checkpoint`と`TelemetryTrace`は90日保管（PoC基準）。PIIマスク済みのためローカル保持が可能。\n- `PlanDocument` と `ApprovalRequest` はPoC期間中保持し監査レポート作成に利用。\nEOF"],"workdir":"/Users/negishi/develop/NRI_AI_Agent_Poc"}
