[2m2025-10-13T08:06:30.258815Z[0m [32m INFO[0m ToolCall: shell {"command":["bash","-lc","cat <<'EOF' > /Users/negishi/develop/NRI_AI_Agent_Poc/specs/001-create-principles-focused/tasks.md\n---\ndescription: \"Task list template for feature implementation\"\n---\n\n# Tasks: UX一貫性原則に基づくBrowser MCP統制\n\n**Input**: Design documents from `/specs/001-create-principles-focused/`\n**Prerequisites**: plan.md (required), spec.md (required for user stories), research.md, data-model.md, contracts/\n\n**Tests**: This feature mandates automated verification for UX SLAとRuntime承認。Playwrightテストおよびユニットテストを各ストーリー内で実施する。\n\n**Organization**: Tasks are grouped by user story to enable independent implementation and testing of each story.\n\n## 憲章準拠タスク指針\n- ヒト主導承認ループ: 承認ポイントの実装・テストタスクを各ユーザーストーリーに明示すること。\n- スコープ固定と最小権限: Browser MCP以外の操作や新スコープを追加する場合は、別タスクで憲章改訂準備を入れること。\n- 完全可観測性と説明責任: Telemetry/Explainability/監査ログの更新タスクを必須項目として盛り込むこと。\n- 再現可能なセッション管理: Pause/Resume、Retry、チェックポイント検証のタスクを割り当てること。\n- 最小構成の拡張性ガードレール: 新規コンポーネントを増やす場合は複雑性トラッキングへの入力タスクを追加すること。\n\n## Format: `[ID] [P?] [Story] Description`\n- **[P]**: Can run in parallel (different files, no dependencies)\n- **[Story]**: Which user story this task belongs to (e.g., US1, US2, US3)\n- Include exact file paths in descriptions\n\n## Phase 1: Setup (Shared Infrastructure)\n\n**Purpose**: Electron/Node環境およびPoC特有の安全設定を整備する。\n\n- [ ] T001 [Setup] Install project dependencies (`package.json`, `yarn.lock`) and ensure Electron/Playwright versions match plan.md\n- [ ] T002 [Setup] Bootstrap config directory with `config/scopes.browser.json`, `config/telemetry.json`, and example entries from Documents/requirements.md\n- [ ] T003 [Setup] Initialize SQLite state-store schema migrations (`src/state-store/migrations/0001_init.sql`)\n- [ ] T004 [Setup] Generate `.env.local` with `SAFE_STORAGE_KEY` and document usage in README supplement\n\n---\n\n## Phase 2: Foundational (Blocking Prerequisites)\n\n**Purpose**: Coreインフラを構築し、全ユーザーストーリーの土台を整える。\n\n- [ ] T005 [Foundational] Implement encrypted SQLite adapter (`src/state-store/index.ts`) with safeStorage key loading\n- [ ] T006 [Foundational] Build base LangGraph orchestrator skeleton (`src/orchestrator/graph.ts`) covering PLANNING→AWAITING_PREAPPROVAL→RUNNING states\n- [ ] T007 [Foundational] Implement Compliance Middleware shell (`src/compliance/runtime-gate.ts`) with policy hooks (no triggers yet)\n- [ ] T008 [Foundational] Scaffold Gate UI shell (`src/gate-ui/App.tsx`) displaying placeholder Plan information\n- [ ] T009 [Foundational] Set up OpenTelemetry exporter (`src/telemetry/otlp-file-exporter.ts`) writing to `var/telemetry/`\n- [ ] T010 [Foundational] Establish PII masking utility (`src/executor/pii-masker.ts`) and unit tests (`tests/unit/pii-masker.test.ts`)\n- [ ] T011 [Foundational] Configure Playwright test project scaffolding for Gate/Telemetry suites (`playwright.config.ts`)\n\n**Checkpoint**: Foundation ready - user story implementation can now begin in parallel\n\n---\n\n## Phase 3: User Story 1 - 一貫した承認UIで計画を審査する (Priority: P1) 🎯 MVP\n\n**Goal**: Pre承認フローをGate UIで一貫表示し、承認/却下をState Storeと監査ログへ反映する。\n\n**Independent Test**: Plan生成→Gate表示→Approve/Reject→状態遷移→ログ記録までの自動化シナリオを回して検証する。\n\n### Tests for User Story 1 (TDD)\n\n- [ ] T012 [P] [US1] Playwright test: Pre-approval modal renders plan summary・Explainability digest (`tests/gate/pre-approval.spec.ts`)\n- [ ] T013 [P] [US1] Playwright test: Reject path returns to PLANNING and logs decision (`tests/gate/pre-approval-reject.spec.ts`)\n- [ ] T014 [US1] Vitest: State Store writes approval record (`tests/unit/state-store-approvals.test.ts`)\n\n### Implementation for User Story 1\n\n- [ ] T015 [US1] Implement Plan summary endpoint (`src/orchestrator/api/pre-approval.ts`) using data-model fields\n- [ ] T016 [US1] Implement Gate UI modal with Plan summary, steps, Explainability digest (`src/gate-ui/components/PreApprovalModal.tsx`)\n- [ ] T017 [US1] Wire Gate UI to orchestrator via IPC/HTTP bridge (`src/gate-ui/services/pre-approval-client.ts`)\n- [ ] T018 [US1] Persist approval decisions (`src/state-store/approval-repository.ts`) and append to `approval.audit.jsonl`\n- [ ] T019 [US1] Update LangGraph transition for Approve/Reject handling (`src/orchestrator/graph.ts`)\n- [ ] T020 [US1] Integrate telemetry span creation for pre-approval (`src/telemetry/span-factory.ts`)\n- [ ] T021 [US1] Document Gate UI accessibility conformance (WCAG AA) and aria roles (`docs/gate-ui/accessibility.md`)\n\n**Checkpoint**: User Story 1 ready for demo (Pre承認ループ + 監査記録 + Telemetry)\n\n---\n\n## Phase 4: User Story 2 - 危険操作をRuntime承認で制御する (Priority: P1)\n\n**Goal**: Runtime承認フローを実装し、external_submit / upload / download / dangerous_eval / bulk_input / external_domainの各トリガーでGate介入させる。\n\n**Independent Test**: Execution中に各トリガーを発火させ、Runtime GateでApprove/Rejectを操作したあとの状態遷移とログを確認する。\n\n### Tests for User Story 2 (TDD)\n\n- [ ] T022 [P] [US2] Playwright test: external_submit requires runtime approval (`tests/runtime-approval/external-submit.spec.ts`)\n- [ ] T023 [P] [US2] Playwright test: upload/download triggers runtime gate with file metadata (`tests/runtime-approval/file-ops.spec.ts`)\n- [ ] T024 [P] [US2] Playwright test: dangerous_eval/bulk_input trigger and log approvals (`tests/runtime-approval/dangerous-eval.spec.ts`)\n- [ ] T025 [US2] Vitest: Compliance middleware policy evaluation unit tests (`tests/unit/compliance-policy.test.ts`)\n\n### Implementation for User Story 2\n\n- [ ] T026 [US2] Extend Compliance Middleware to detect all triggers (`src/compliance/runtime-gate.ts`)\n- [ ] T027 [US2] Implement runtime approval API endpoints (`src/orchestrator/api/runtime-approval.ts`)\n- [ ] T028 [US2] Update Gate UI runtime modal (`src/gate-ui/components/RuntimeApprovalModal.tsx`) with domain, reason, impact\n- [ ] T029 [US2] Append runtime approval persistence (`src/state-store/approval-repository.ts`) with latency capture\n- [ ] T030 [US2] Update Supervisor Patch invocation on reject (`src/orchestrator/graph.ts`)\n- [ ] T031 [US2] Enhance telemetry spans for runtime approvals (`src/telemetry/span-factory.ts`)\n- [ ] T032 [US2] Mask PII before logging runtime payloads (`src/executor/pii-masker.ts`)\n\n**Checkpoint**: Runtime承認フローが全トリガーで動作し、200ms SLA・ログ整合性を満たす。\n\n---\n\n## Phase 5: User Story 3 - 一貫したExplainabilityとトレースで監査する (Priority: P2)\n\n**Goal**: ExplainabilityデータとOpenTelemetryトレースの整合性を確保し、監査担当者に一貫した可観測性を提供する。\n\n**Independent Test**: 代表ユースケースを実行し、ExplainabilityフィールドとTelemetry出力が完全一致することを自動テストで検証する。\n\n### Tests for User Story 3 (TDD)\n\n- [ ] T033 [P] [US3] Playwright test: Explainability block renders what/why/how/evidence (`tests/telemetry/explainability-consistency.spec.ts`)\n- [ ] T034 [P] [US3] Playwright test: Stop→Resume preserves checkpoint info (<200ms) (`tests/telemetry/checkpoint-resume.spec.ts`)\n- [ ] T035 [US3] Vitest: Telemetry exporter ensures span attributes contain Explainability IDs (`tests/unit/telemetry-exporter.test.ts`)\n\n### Implementation for User Story 3\n\n- [ ] T036 [US3] Link Explainability data to telemetry spans (`src/telemetry/span-factory.ts`)\n- [ ] T037 [US3] Populate Decision Card with telemetry-linked Explainability (`src/gate-ui/components/DecisionCard.tsx`)\n- [ ] T038 [US3] Implement checkpoint persistence end-to-end (`src/state-store/checkpoint-repository.ts`)\n- [ ] T039 [US3] Ensure resume path reuses prior approvals without re-requesting (`src/orchestrator/graph.ts`)\n- [ ] T040 [US3] Provide telemetry inspection CLI (`src/cli/inspect-telemetry.ts`) meeting quickstart instructions\n\n**Checkpoint**: Explainability・Telemetry・Checkpointが整合し、監査担当者の独立検証が可能になる。\n\n---\n\n## Phase N: Polish & Cross-Cutting Concerns\n\n- [ ] T041 [P] Polish Consolidate config docs (`docs/config/README.md`) and align with quickstart\n- [ ] T042 Polish UX runbook for Gate approvers (`docs/gate-ui/runbook.md`)\n- [ ] T043 [P] Polish Performance tuning pass to ensure 150/200/300ms SLA under load (`scripts/perf/measure-runtime.js`)\n- [ ] T044 Polish Review security posture (PII masking, scopes) and document checks (`docs/security/posture.md`)\n- [ ] T045 Polish Final telemetry export sanity check and retention policy enforcement (`scripts/maintenance/purge-expired-checkpoints.ts`)\n\n---\n\n## Dependencies & Execution Order\n\n### Phase Dependencies\n- Setup (Phase 1) → Foundational (Phase 2) → User Story 1 (Phase 3) → User Story 2 (Phase 4) → User Story 3 (Phase 5) → Polish\n- User Story 2 depends on completion of User Story 1 foundation (approval repository, telemetry spans)\n- User Story 3 depends on both Story 1 & 2 for Explainability and runtime approval hooks\n\n### User Story Dependencies\n- US1 (P1): No dependency except Foundational completion\n- US2 (P1): Depends on US1 data persistence and Gate UI base components\n- US3 (P2): Depends on US1とUS2で生成されるExplainabilityとTelemetry統合\n\n### Within Each User Story\n- Tests (Playwright/Vitest) first to enforce TDD where specified\n- Data repositories before UI/Orchestrator integration\n- Telemetry/Logging hooks after core flow完成\n\n### Parallel Opportunities\n- Setup phase tasks touching異なるディレクトリ（config, migrations, docs）は並列可能\n- FoundationでOpenTelemetry・PIIマスカー・Playwright設定は[ P ]扱い\n- US1/US2/US3内のPlaywrightテストは互いに[ P ]で並列実行可（異なるspecファイル）\n- Telemetry/State-store/CLIなど異なるフォルダは並列実装しやすい\n\n### Parallel Example: User Story 2\n```\n# Tests (parallel):\nT022, T023, T024  # 各Playwright spec\n\n# Implementation (parallelバケット):\nT026 (middleware) / T027 (API) / T028 (UI) / T031 (telemetry)  # 異なるディレクトリ\n```\n\n---\n\n## Implementation Strategy\n\n### MVP First (User Story 1)\n1. 完了: Setup + Foundational\n2. US1のGate UI Pre承認フローとログ連携を完成\n3. SLAとログが揃ったら承認プロセスをデモ\n\n### Incremental Delivery\n1. US1デリバリ後、US2でRuntime承認トリガーを拡張\n2. US3でExplainability/Telemetry統合を仕上げ監査性を確保\n3. 各ストーリーごとにPlaywright/Vitest自動テストをパスしてから次へ進む\n\n### Parallel Team Strategy\n- 2人チームの場合: 1人はGate UI/Telemetry、もう1人はState Store/Complianceを担当\n- US2+US3は各テストスイートを分担し、実装タスクはディレクトリ単位で衝突を避ける\n\n---\n\n## Notes\n- [P] tasks = 異なるファイル・ディレクトリのため並行可能\n- 各ユーザーストーリー完了時にSLAメトリクスを確認し、基準外ならPolishフェーズで改善\n- Explainability/Telemetryの整合性テストはUS3で集約するが、失敗がUS1/US2実装に起因する場合は注意\nEOF"],"workdir":"/Users/negishi/develop/NRI_AI_Agent_Poc"}
