[2m2025-10-13T10:41:00.939087Z[0m [32m INFO[0m ToolCall: shell {"command":["bash","-lc","cat <<'EOF' > docs/security/posture.md\n# Security Posture Checklist\n\n## Scopes & Network\n- Browser MCP restricted to `allowed_domains` defined in `config/scopes.browser.json`.\n- Runtime approvals enforced for all external submissions, downloads, uploads, dangerous JS evaluations, bulk input, and external navigation.\n\n## Data Protection\n- Checkpoint/approval data stored in encrypted SQLite with `SAFE_STORAGE_KEY`.\n- `approval.audit.jsonl` writes masked payloads; PII hashed deterministically.\n- Telemetry exporter writes to local OTLP JSON files (no external collector).\n\n## Operational Controls\n- Single-session operation enforced; no auto-scheduling tasks run unattended.\n- Audit CLI (`yarn inspect:telemetry`) used to review spans for anomalies.\n- Supervisor Patch invoked on runtime rejects to prevent repeated execution.\n\n## Follow-up Actions\n- Rotate `SAFE_STORAGE_KEY` per device when staff changes occur.\n- Review `Documents/requirements.md` quarterly for domain/trigger updates.\n- Run `scripts/perf/measure-runtime.js` monthly to maintain SLA compliance.\nEOF"]}
[2m2025-10-13T10:41:10.019987Z[0m [32m INFO[0m ToolCall: shell {"command":["bash","-lc","cat <<'EOF' > scripts/maintenance/purge-expired-checkpoints.ts\n#!/usr/bin/env node\nimport { resolve } from \"node:path\";\nimport { existsSync, readFileSync } from \"node:fs\";\nimport { StateStore } from \"@state-store/index\";\n\nconst retentionDays = Number(process.env.CHECKPOINT_RETENTION_DAYS ?? 90);\nconst cutoff = Date.now() - retentionDays * 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000;\n\nconst store = StateStore.getInstance();\nstore.init();\n\nconst dbFile = resolve(process.cwd(), \"var/state-store/state.db\");\nif (!existsSync(dbFile)) {\n  console.log(\"State store not found; nothing to purge.\");\n  process.exit(0);\n}\n\nconst db = (store as unknown as { db: any }).db;\nconst checkpoints = db\n  .prepare(`SELECT checkpoint_id, created_at FROM checkpoints`)\n  .all();\n\nlet purged = 0;\nfor (const row of checkpoints) {\n  const created = Date.parse(row.created_at);\n  if (!Number.isNaN(created) && created < cutoff) {\n    db.prepare(`DELETE FROM checkpoints WHERE checkpoint_id = ?`).run(row.checkpoint_id);\n    purged += 1;\n  }\n}\n\nconsole.log(`Purged ${purged} checkpoints older than ${retentionDays} days.`);\nEOF"],"workdir":"/Users/negishi/develop/NRI_AI_Agent_Poc"}
