tion: Reference to stored MCP connection settings\n        approverIds:\n          type: array\n          items:\n            type: string\n        notes:\n          type: string\n        notifyChannels:\n          type: array\n          items:\n            type: string\n    LiveSession:\n      type: object\n      required: [sessionId, status, startedAt, planId]\n      properties:\n        sessionId:\n          type: string\n        status:\n          type: string\n          enum: [running, passed, failed, aborted]\n        startedAt:\n          type: string\n          format: date-time\n        endedAt:\n          type: string\n          format: date-time\n          nullable: true\n        planId:\n          type: string\n        approverIds:\n          type: array\n          items:\n            type: string\n        sla:\n          type: object\n          properties:\n            gateLatencyP50Ms:\n              type: integer\n            pauseResumeP95Ms:\n              type: integer\n            violations:\n              type: array\n              items:\n                $ref: '#/components/schemas/SlaViolation'\n        telemetry:\n          $ref: '#/components/schemas/TelemetryBundleList'\n    RuntimeApprovalDecision:\n      type: object\n      required: [trigger, approved, approverId]\n      properties:\n        trigger:\n          type: string\n          enum: [external_submit, upload, download, external_domain, bulk_input, dangerous_eval]\n        approved:\n          type: boolean\n        approverId:\n          type: string\n        rationale:\n          type: string\n        latencyMs:\n          type: integer\n        screenshotPath:\n          type: string\n    TelemetryBundleList:\n      type: object\n      required: [items]\n      properties:\n        items:\n          type: array\n          items:\n            $ref: '#/components/schemas/TelemetryBundleItem'\n    TelemetryBundleItem:\n      type: object\n      required: [bundleId, stepId, spanPath, explainabilityPath]\n      properties:\n        bundleId:\n          type: string\n        stepId:\n          type: string\n        spanPath:\n          type: string\n        explainabilityPath:\n          type: string\n        screenshotPath:\n          type: string\n        browserLogPath:\n          type: string\n    SlaViolation:\n      type: object\n      required: [type, occurredAt]\n      properties:\n        type:\n          type: string\n          enum: [gate_latency, pause_resume, telemetry_flush, approval_timeout, connection_drop]\n        occurredAt:\n          type: string\n          format: date-time\n        details:\n          type: string\n    TestNotificationRequest:\n      type: object\n      required: [channel]\n      properties:\n        channel:\n          type: string\n        message:\n          type: string\n          default: \"Live MCP notification test\"\nEOF"]}
[2m2025-10-13T12:00:09.643438Z[0m [32m INFO[0m ToolCall: shell {"command":["bash","-lc","cat <<'EOF' > /Users/negishi/develop/NRI_AI_Agent_Poc/specs/003-mcp/quickstart.md\n# Quickstart: 実ブラウザMCP統合E2Eフレーム\n\n## 前提条件\n- Node.js 20.x / Yarn 1.x\n- Playwright 1.47+ ブラウザ依存モジュール（`yarn playwright install --with-deps` 済）\n- Electron 28.x ビルド済み\n- Browser MCP ホスト `https://mcp.local:4123` へ到達可能（PoCラボLAN）\n- mTLSクライアント証明書 (`config/live-mcp/client.pfx`) と認証トークン (`config/live-mcp/token.enc`) を取得済み\n- Slack Incoming Webhook URL を `.env.live` に設定\n\n## セットアップ\n1. 依存関係インストール\n   ```bash\nyarn install\n   ```\n2. ライブ接続設定を生成\n   ```bash\ncp config/live-mcp/example.config.json config/live-mcp/default.config.json\n# host / timeout / allowed_domains を必要に応じて編集\n   ```\n3. 認証情報をsafeStorageに登録\n   ```bash\nyarn generate:key --output .env.local\nnode scripts/live/store-token.js --token-file config/live-mcp/token.enc\n   ```\n4. Electron Gateをライブモードで起動\n   ```bash\nyarn dev --live\n   ```\n\n## ライブPlaywrightテストの実行\n```bash\nexport LIVE_SESSION_NOTES=\"Nightly live regression\"\nyarn test:playwright:live --config playwright.live.config.ts\n```\n- テストはBrowser MCP起動→Gate承認待機→SLA収集→終了まで自動実行\n- 承認待ち中はSlack `#mcp-live` に残り時間と承認URLが送信されます\n\n## レポート生成\n```bash\nSESSION_ID=live-20251013-001\nyarn report:live-session $SESSION_ID\nopen reports/$SESSION_ID/index.html\n```\n- HTMLとJSONの両方が`reports/<sessionId>/` に出力されます\n\n## 通知テスト\n```bash\nyarn notification:test --channel \"#mcp-live\"\n```\n- Webhook経由でテストメッセージが送信され、接続確認が可能\n\n## トラブルシューティング\n- **PlaywrightがMCPへ接続できない**: `config/live-mcp/default.config.json` のホストと証明書パスを確認。VPN不要なはずだが、LAN疎通を`curl https://mcp.local:4123/status`で確認。\n- **承認がタイムアウトする**: Gate UIが起動しているか、承認者がログインしているか確認。Slack通知に含まれるURLから再承認可能。\n- **SLA違反通知が多発**: `node scripts/perf/measure-runtime.js` でローカル性能を測定し、Electron/PlaywrightのCPUリソースを確保する。\n- **スクリーンショットが保存されない**: `var/live-sessions/<sessionId>/screenshots/` の容量を確認し、10GB上限に達していないか `scripts/maintenance/purge-expired-checkpoints.ts` を実行する。\n\n## クリーンアップ\n```bash\nrm -rf var/live-sessions/*\nrm -rf reports/*\n```\n- 実行前に監査が完了していることを確認してください。\nEOF"]}
