[2m2025-10-13T12:02:24.992779Z[0m [32m INFO[0m ToolCall: shell {"command":["bash","-lc","cat <<'EOF' > specs/003-mcp/tasks.md\n---\ndescription: \"Task list for live Browser MCP end-to-end integration\"\n---\n\n# Tasks: 実ブラウザMCP統合E2Eフレーム\n\n**Input**: Design documents from `/specs/003-mcp/`\n**Prerequisites**: plan.md, spec.md, research.md, data-model.md, contracts/\n\n**Tests**: ライブモードを安全に検証するため、PlaywrightライブシナリオおよびSLA測定スクリプトを各ユーザーストーリーで実施する。\n\n**Organization**: Tasks are grouped by user story to enable independent implementation and testing of each story。\n\n## 憲章準拠タスク指針\n- ヒト主導承認ループ: Playwrightフローはヒト承認待ちを尊重し、承認タイムアウトのテストタスクを含める。\n- スコープ固定と最小権限: MCP接続設定はallowed_domains内、設定変更はレビュータスクで管理。\n- 完全可観測性と説明責任: Telemetry/Explainability/通知を必ず実装・テストする。\n- 再現可能なセッション管理: Checkpoint復元と200ms SLA検証タスクを用意する。\n- 最小構成の拡張性ガードレール: 追加コンポーネントは `src/live/`・`scripts/live/` に限定し、既存責務を崩さない。\n\n## Format: `[ID] [P?] [Story] Description`\n- **[P]**: Can run in parallel (different files, no dependencies)\n- **[Story]**: Which user story this task belongs to (e.g., US1, US2, US3)\n- Include exact file paths in descriptions\n\n## Phase 1: Setup (Shared Infrastructure)\n\n**Purpose**: ライブMCP統合に必要な環境・認証・通知設定を整える。\n\n- [ ] T001 [Setup] Install/update dependencies (`package.json`, `yarn.lock`) including Playwright live browsers\n- [ ] T002 [Setup] Scaffold live MCP config (`config/live-mcp/default.config.json`) with host/timeout placeholders\n- [ ] T003 [Setup] Encrypt MCP token + mTLS証明書 via safeStorage (`scripts/live/store-token.ts`)\n- [ ] T004 [Setup] Create Slack/Webhook env file (`.env.live`) and document channel usage in `docs/config/README.md`\n- [ ] T005 [Setup] Provision telemetry storage directories (`var/live-sessions/`, `reports/`) with retention job scheduling\n- [ ] T006 [Setup] Update developer docs (`docs/config/README.md`) with live-mode prerequisites\n\n---\n\n## Phase 2: Foundational (Blocking Prerequisites)\n\n**Purpose**: ライブモード基盤（MCPランチャ、承認同期、通知、SLA測定）を構築する。\n\n- [ ] T007 [Foundational] Implement MCP launcher CLI (`scripts/live/launch-mcp.ts`) handling mTLS + token auth\n- [ ] T008 [Foundational] Add live session controller (`src/live/session-manager.ts`) for start/stop lifecycle\n- [ ] T009 [Foundational] Extend state store schema migration for live entities (`src/state-store/migrations/0002_live.sql`)\n- [ ] T010 [Foundational] Implement Slack notifier module (`src/live/notifier.ts`) with retry/backoff\n- [ ] T011 [Foundational] Implement telemetry bundle writer (`src/live/telemetry-bundle.ts`) aligning with data-model\n- [ ] T012 [Foundational] Build SLA timer utilities (`scripts/perf/sla-monitor.ts`) integrated with notifier\n- [ ] T013 [Foundational] Configure Playwright live config (`playwright.live.config.ts`) referencing MCP launcher\n\n**Checkpoint**: Foundation ready - live session can launch, collect telemetry, and send notifications\n\n---\n\n## Phase 3: User Story 1 - QAが実MCPと接続したE2Eテストを実行する (Priority: P1) 🎯 MVP\n\n**Goal**: ライブBrowser MCPを自動起動し、PlaywrightでPlan→Approve→Executeフローを完走させて監査ログを生成する。\n\n**Independent Test**: `yarn test:playwright:live` 実行でMCP接続～Gate承認～監査ログ生成まで確認し、セッションIDごとの記録を検証する。\n\n### Tests for User Story 1 (TDD)\n- [ ] T014 [P] [US1] Playwright: launch MCP + execute happy path (`tests/live/qa/happy-path.spec.ts`)\n- [ ] T015 [P] [US1] Playwright: retry on MCP connection failure (`tests/live/qa/retry-connection.spec.ts`)\n- [ ] T016 [US1] Vitest: session manager handles state transitions (`tests/unit/live-session-manager.test.ts`)\n\n### Implementation for User Story 1\n- [ ] T017 [US1] Implement Playwright global setup/teardown (`tests/live/global-setup.ts`, `global-teardown.ts`)\n- [ ] T018 [US1] Wire session manager with Playwright hooks (`tests/live/utils/session-hooks.ts`)\n- [ ] T019 [US1] Persist LiveTestSession records (`src/state-store/live-session-repository.ts`)\n- [ ] T020 [US1] Append audit log writer for live runs (`src/state-store/approval-audit-live.ts`)\n- [ ] T021 [US1] Generate MCP start/stop logs (`src/live/loggers/mcp-lifecycle.ts`)\n\n**Checkpoint**: US1完了後、手動承認を待つライブE2Eテストが成功し監査ログが保存される。\n\n---\n\n## Phase 4: User Story 2 - 承認者がリアルタイムでGate操作しながらMCPを監視する (Priority: P1)\n\n**Goal**: Gate承認UIとリアルタイム同期し、Approve/Rejectを即時反映。Reject時はSupervisor Patchを稼働させる。\n\n**Independent Test**: ライブテスト中にGate UI操作を行い、200ms以内にMCP制御が反映され、Reject時はSupervisor Patchログが生成されるか検証。\n\n### Tests for User Story 2 (TDD)\n- [ ] T022 [P] [US2] Playwright: runtime approval approves and resumes MCP (`tests/live/runtime/approve.spec.ts`)\n- [ ] T023 [P] [US2] Playwright: runtime reject triggers supervisor patch (`tests/live/runtime/reject.spec.ts`)\n- [ ] T024 [US2] Vitest: compliance middleware live trigger detection (`tests/unit/live-runtime-gate.test.ts`)\n\n### Implementation for User Story 2\n- [ ] T025 [US2] Implement WebSocket approval channel (`src/gate-ui/services/live-approval-channel.ts`)\n- [ ] T026 [US2] Update Gate UI runtime modal with live telemetry (`src/gate-ui/components/RuntimeApprovalModal.tsx`)\n- [ ] T027 [US2] Extend compliance middleware with live trigger handling (`src/compliance/live-runtime-gate.ts`)\n- [ ] T028 [US2] Implement supervisor patch executor (`src/live/supervisor-patch.ts`)\n- [ ] T029 [US2] Persist runtime approvals with latency (`src/state-store/live-approval-repository.ts`)\n- [ ] T030 [US2] Add approval timeout watchdog (`src/live/approval-timeout.ts`)\n\n**Checkpoint**: US2完了でGate UI操作がリアルタイムにMCPへ反映し、拒否時の安全停止と監査が成立。\n\n---\n\n## Phase 5: User Story 3 - オブザーバビリティ担当が実行ログとテレメトリを可視化する (Priority: P2)\n\n**Goal**: Explainability＋OpenTelemetry＋スクリーンショット＋SLAを統合し、レポートと通知に反映する。\n\n**Independent Test**: ライブセッション終了後に `yarn report:live-session <sessionId>` を実行し、Slack通知とレポート生成が整合するか確認する。\n\n### Tests for User Story 3 (TDD)\n- [ ] T031 [P] [US3] Playwright: telemetry bundle created per step (`tests/live/telemetry/bundle.spec.ts`)\n- [ ] T032 [US3] Vitest: report generator combines spans/explainability (`tests/unit/live-report-generator.test.ts`)\n- [ ] T033 [US3] Vitest: storage retention job purges old bundles (`tests/unit/live-retention.test.ts`)\n\n### Implementation for User Story 3\n- [ ] T034 [US3] Implement telemetry bundler integration (`src/live/telemetry-bundle.ts`)\n- [ ] T035 [US3] Build live session report generator CLI (`src/cli/report-live-session.ts`)\n- [ ] T036 [US3] Capture MCP screenshots/network logs (`src/live/mcp-artifact-capture.ts`)\n- [ ] T037 [US3] Add SLA analyzer + summary JSON (`src/live/sla-summary.ts`)\n- [ ] T038 [US3] Wire Slack notification job with report links (`scripts/live/notify-report.ts`)\n- [ ] T039 [US3] Schedule retention job (`scripts/maintenance/purge-live-artifacts.ts`)\n\n**Checkpoint**: US3完了でレポートと通知が整備され、監査担当がライブ結果を確認可能。\n\n---\n\n## Phase N: Polish & Cross-Cutting Concerns\n\n- [ ] T040 [P] Polish Update `docs/gate-ui/runbook.md` with live workflow & troubleshooting\n- [ ] T041 [P] Polish Finalize SLA dashboard JSON schema (`docs/telemetry/sla-schema.json`)\n- [ ] T042 [P] Polish Load test live runner (`scripts/perf/k6-live-smoke.js`) and document results\n- [ ] T043 Polish Security review of live configs (rotate creds, confirm scopes) (`docs/security/posture.md`)\n- [ ] T044 Polish Create onboarding guide for QA/approver (`docs/live/onboarding.md`)\n\n---\n\n## Dependencies & Execution Order\n\n### Phase Dependencies\n- Setup (Phase 1) → Foundational (Phase 2) → US1 (Phase 3) → US2 (Phase 4) → US3 (Phase 5) → Polish\n- US1によりライブセッション基盤と監査ログが整備されることがUS2/US3の前提\n- US2がGate同期とSupervisor Patchを提供し、US3の可観測性処理が依存\n\n### User Story Dependencies\n- **US1 (P1)**: Foundational完了が必須\n- **US2 (P1)**: US1で作成したライブセッション基盤・Gate連携に依存\n- **US3 (P2)**: US1/US2で生成されるTelemetry/Auditを利用\n\n### Within Each User Story\n- Playwright/Vitestテストを先に作成し、承認/テレメトリの期待値を確定させる\n- データ/リポジトリ層→サービス層→UI/CLIの順で実装\n- 通知やレポートなど追加出力は本体フロー完成後に統合\n\n### Parallel Opportunities\n- Setupでは設定ファイル作成(T002/T004)とディレクトリ準備(T005)を並行実施\n- Foundationalでランチャ(T007)・通知(T010)・テレメトリ(T011)は別フォルダで並列可能\n- US1/US2/US3 の Playwright テスト (T014/T015/T022/T023/T031) は互いに [P] 指定で並列実行\n- レポート生成(T035)とSLA解析(T037)は独立ファイルのため同時進行可\n\n### Parallel Example: User Story 2\n```\n# Tests (parallel)\nT022, T023\n\n# Implementation buckets\nT025 (WebSocket channel) / T027 (middleware) / T028 (supervisor patch) / T029 (repository)\n```\n\n---\n\n## Implementation Strategy\n\n### MVP First (User Story 1)\n1. Complete Setup + Foundational tasks\n2. DeliverライブE2Eテスト（MCP起動〜監査ログ）を実現\n3. SLA計測と監査ログ確認後、ステークホルダーへデモ\n\n### Incremental Delivery\n1. US1で自動テスト基盤を固める\n2. US2でヒト承認連携と安全停止を拡張\n3. US3で可観測性データとレポートを完成させ、通知導線を整備\n\n### Parallel Team Strategy\n- 開発者A: MCPランチャ・セッション管理・Playwright統合（US1中心）\n- 開発者B: Gate UI / Supervisor Patch / 承認レポジトリ（US2）\n- 開発者C: テレメトリ／レポート／通知（US3、Polish）\n- 共有リソース: Slack通知+SLA測定の調整やPoC運用メンバーとの連携\n\n---\n\n## Notes\n- [P] tasks = 異なるファイルや責務のため並列実行可能\n- Playwrightライブテスト実行前に `yarn playwright install --with-deps` を必ず実施\n- ライブテストは実ハードウェア制約があるため、夜間バッチ実行を想定したCI設定が必要\n- 監査ログとレポートはPoCセキュリティポリシに従ってローカル保管・削除ルールを守る\nEOF"]}
