[2m2025-10-13T13:21:31.049580Z[0m [32m INFO[0m ToolCall: shell {"command":["bash","-lc","cat <<'EOF' > docs/live/onboarding.md\n# Live Mode QA / Approver Onboarding\n\n## 1. Accounts & Access\n- Ensure you have Gate UI credentials with runtime approval permission.\n- Request access to the secure channel storing `.env.live` values (Slack webhook, secret IDs).\n- Install Playwright browsers locally via `npx playwright install --with-deps`.\n\n## 2. Local Environment Setup\n1. Clone the repository and checkout the feature branch.\n2. Run `yarn install` followed by `yarn live:bootstrap-storage`.\n3. Import secrets using `yarn live:store-token --key <name> --token-file path/to/token.txt` for MCP credentials.\n4. Copy `.env.live` from the secure channel and populate environment values.\n5. Verify configuration with `yarn live:launch-mcp --no-spawn --json` to confirm domains/timeout are correct.\n\n## 3. Daily Workflow\n- Start the Electron Gate UI: `yarn dev`.\n- Launch the live test harness when ready: `yarn test:playwright:live --project=live-chromium`.\n- Wait for runtime modals; approve/reject within the SLA (200ms resume target, 5分 timeout).\n- After each session, run `yarn replay:plan <sessionId> --json` and review `reports/live-sessions/<sessionId>.json`.\n\n## 4. Troubleshooting Checklist\n- **MCP接続不可**: Re-run `yarn live:launch-mcp --no-spawn --json`, confirm secrets are rotated, and inspect logs at `var/live-sessions/logs/`.\n- **Runtimeモーダルが表示されない**: Check `approval.audit.jsonl` for pending requests and ensure Gate UI websocket is active.\n- **通知が届かない**: Verify `SLACK_LIVE_WEBHOOK_URL`, rerun `scripts/live/notify-report.ts <sessionId>`, and inspect console errors.\n- **テレメトリ欠損**: Confirm `var/live-sessions/telemetry/<sessionId>/` has bundles; if not, rerun tests and file an incident.\n\n## 5. Sign-off Checklist\n- All runtime approvals recorded in Gate UI and `approval.audit.jsonl`.\n- Session report generated and shared (`yarn report:live-session <sessionId> --json`).\n- SLA breaches reviewed; remediation actions captured in the incident log.\n- Secrets rotated if an incident involved credential exposure.\nEOF\n"],"timeout_ms":120000,"workdir":"."}
